<title>USA: Borealis says H-P ends talks.</title>
<headline>Borealis says H-P ends talks.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Borealis Technical Inc Ltd, a unit of Borealis Exploration Ltd, said Tuesday that Hewlett-Packard Co ended talks regarding Borealis' refrigeration technology.</p>
<p>Borealis said Hewlett-Packard felt the technology, in the best possible case, was three years away from a marketable product.</p>
<p>Borealis said it is working to develop a prototype in about six months and a production model in about 18 months.</p>
<p>It said it is in talks with major corporations on this and other technologies.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
